<title>UK: London coal/ore fixtures.</title>
<headline>London coal/ore fixtures.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>COAL - Singapore Ace - 120,000/10 tonnes coal Long Beach/S.Korea 1/10 Aug $8 fio seven days shinc Kepco.</p>
<p>Continental Spirit - 55,000/10 Roberts Bank/Taranto 10/15 July $12.50 fio 2.5 days shinc/25,000 shinc Ilva.</p>
<p>ORE - SCF Vladimir - 45,000/10 tonnes bauxite Kamsar/Point Comfort 12/19 July $5.25 fio 24,000 shinc/15,000 shinc Guinomar.</p>
<p>Anangel Solidarity - 145,000 tonnes ore Tubarao/Beilun 25 July-5 Aug $10.15 fio scale load/20,000 shex CMIEC.</p>
</text>
